;------------------------------------------------- -;

; Bus
[BG 96]
type = Normal; image display type. Normal = still image, Anim = animated pictures, Parallax = three-dimensional still image (one-point perspective)
spriteNo = 1,0; image file (*. sff) display the image. Protection is needed at the time of Anim
layerNo = 0; layer attribute. 0 = back, displayed in front of 1 =
start = 641, -1; axis position. Def file is set in the vertical position from the count
delta = 1.0, 1.0; characters moved at the speed of the scroll. With decimals
trans = None; transparent process. Add = added processing (translucent glow), Add1 = semi-transparent, Sub = subtraction processing (translucent shadow), None = not transparent
mask = 1; image to the background color of whether or not transparent. 1 = Yes, 0 = No
tile = 0,0; tile images of the same whether or not to display multiple (and X, Y)
tilespacing = 0,0; interval between the images of tiles.
ActionNo = 20; No. use of animation.
velocity = 0,0; image transfer rate
ID = 96; BGCtrlDef use to specify the number.

; Front Tire
[BG 97]
type = Anim; image display type. Normal = still image, Anim = animated pictures, Parallax = three-dimensional still image (one-point perspective)
spriteNo = 2,0; image file (*. sff) display the image. Protection is needed at the time of Anim
layerNo = 0; layer attribute. 0 = back, displayed in front of 1 =
start = 641, -1; axis position. Def file is set in the vertical position from the count
delta = 1.0, 1.0; characters moved at the speed of the scroll. With decimals
trans = None; transparent process. Add = added processing (translucent glow), Add1 = semi-transparent, Sub = subtraction processing (translucent shadow), None = not transparent
mask = 1; image to the background color of whether or not transparent. 1 = Yes, 0 = No
tile = 0,0; tile images of the same whether or not to display multiple (and X, Y)
tilespacing = 0,0; interval between the images of tiles.
ActionNo = 97; No. use of animation.
velocity = 0,0; image transfer rate
ID = 96; BGCtrlDef use to specify the number.

; Back Tire
[BG 98]
type = Anim; image display type. Normal = still image, Anim = animated pictures, Parallax = three-dimensional still image (one-point perspective)
spriteNo = 3,0; image file (*. sff) display the image. Protection is needed at the time of Anim
layerNo = 0; layer attribute. 0 = back, displayed in front of 1 =
start = 641, -1; axis position. Def file is set in the vertical position from the count
delta = 1.0, 1.0; characters moved at the speed of the scroll. With decimals
trans = None; transparent process. Add = added processing (translucent glow), Add1 = semi-transparent, Sub = subtraction processing (translucent shadow), None = not transparent
mask = 1; image to the background color of whether or not transparent. 1 = Yes, 0 = No
tile = 0,0; tile images of the same whether or not to display multiple (and X, Y)
tilespacing = 0,0; interval between the images of tiles.
ActionNo = 98; No. use of animation.
velocity = 0,0; image transfer rate
ID = 96; BGCtrlDef use to specify the number.


